D alogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:55.94,Default,[texts,0000,0000,0000,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.34,0:00:07.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Err, Speerio Rosa Burosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:10.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, this Recipe is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:11.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.46,0:00:16.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A Recipe that emits warmth which gives courage and confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:21.41,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Speerio Rosa Burosa
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.45,0:00:29.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wah, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.37,0:00:34.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's great, Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.09,0:00:37.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.05,0:02:26.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We're doing this quite fast... {Wolfy- We're doing this quite fast...}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.05,0:02:28.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Should we wait until it actually drops down? {Wolfy-Should we wait until it (really) drops down?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.78,0:02:30.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:31.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just watch, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:41.57,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Puruvu Radi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:51.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing, Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You've been getting really good at this.{-megu}{You have become really good at this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:55.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's all thanks to you, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:03:00.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,One more remaining, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:03.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:10.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,After gathering all the star drops...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:14.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You'll go back home, right, Yuki-chan? {megu}{You will go back to your country, right, Yuki-chan?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:18.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Ah... Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:24.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be lonely when that time comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:26.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:30.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for suddenly being sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.97,0:03:33.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do my best, so look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.35,0:03:40.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Akihime would never have thought, not even in her dreams... {Wolfy- Akihime would never have thought, not even in her dreams...}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.41,0:03:45.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}that Yuki-chan's real identity... is Tsuwabuki Masaharu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.47,0:03:55.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So now six star drops have been collected.{So now six star drops are gathered.} {So, six star drops are now gathered. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:59.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Soon you'll no longer be Yuki-chan.{Soon you will be graduating from being Yuki-chan.}{Wolfy- Soon you will stop being Yuki-chan} {Soon, you'll no longer become Yuki-chan. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.58,0:04:04.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,How about staying as Yuki-chan, since he is really cute. {Wolfy- How about staying in Yuki-chan's form, since he is really cute.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:05.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Think about me for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:08.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So then, what kind of advice do you need? {wolfy- So then, what kind of advice do you need?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:15.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I want to tell her that Yuki-chan is actually me. {Wolfy- I want to tell Akihime that Yuki-chan is actually me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:18.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want to lie to your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.11,0:04:19.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,M-My girlfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.46,0:04:22.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to feel embarrassed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.43,0:04:27.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,that both you and Akihime are officially a couple in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:31.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's good to be young!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.68,0:04:37.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,However, it won't be long before all seven star drops are gathered.{- megu}{However, soon all seven star droops will be gathered.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.23,0:04:39.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So wouldn't it be better telling her after that? {Wolfy-So wouldn't it be better telling her after that?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:44.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I feel as if I'm deceiving Akihime. {Wolfy- I feel as though I am decieving Akihime.} {It feels as if I'm decieving Akihime. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.59,0:04:46.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I want to tell her the truth as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:49.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I do understand how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:55.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But, you must never do that, Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.41,0:04:57.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Something that can never be reversed will happen. {Something irreparable will happen. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:05:00.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Something that can never be reversed? {same - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:06.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If Yuki-chan's identity is known to Sumomo-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:15.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I guess I'll have to wait until we gather all seven star drops. {Wolfy-I guess I will have to wait until we gather all seven star drops.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.78,0:05:17.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,U-Umm...{Wolfy- E-erm.} {Umm.. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:20.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.55,0:05:25.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:30.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:32.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You just called him Haru-kun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.09,0:05:34.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She did, she did!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:36.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So madly in love, aren't they?{So much in love!} {Wolfy-So madly in love~}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:37.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru, your reply?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:41.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you're going to say "Akihime"? {Wolfy-Don't tell me you're going to say Akihime?} {Don't tell me you're going to say "Akihime"? - with the quotation marks - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:44.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's just natural to use her first name when you were just called by yours. {It's natural to use someone's first name when calling. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.47,0:05:47.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Go Haru-kun! Be courageous and say it! {courageous -> brave - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.90,0:05:49.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:50.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:52.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:53.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:56.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:05:59.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Such good timing too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:00.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The ion exchange resin is... {ion exchange resin... Is that right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:08.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's good if I can do that... {Wolfy- It would be good if I could do that...}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}calling her Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:21.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, what is the matter? Miss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:23.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.53,0:06:30.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Mei...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:33.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Such a high level Recipe used by that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:38.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Without working so hard just because she is Karin-sama's daughter... {Wolfy- And she didn't have to work so hard, just because she is Karin-sama's daughter...}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.16,0:06:45.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.21,0:06:47.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can do it too!{I also can do it!} {Wolfy- I can also do it!}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.73,0:06:59.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan, you can't go home together with me after club activities today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:02.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Today I have to go to the dojo, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:03.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What is it? {Wolfy- What about it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:08.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I was just thinking about visiting Nona-chan on the way home. {Wolfy- I just thought about visiting Nona-chan on the way home}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:11.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Since she hasn't been coming to class for a few days now... {Wolfy- Since she hasn't been coming to class for the past few days}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:13.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,and I'm worried about her. {Wolfy- And I'm worried about her}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Akihime...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:22.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}To Akihime, Yuuki is her rival in gathering the star drops, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:25.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Because Akihime is like that...{Akihime is like that so I.../Because Akihime is like that I...}{Wolfy- Because Akihime is like that...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.77,0:07:30.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Right now, I honestly feel that I can call her by her first name.{Right now I feel I can call her name honestly.}{Wolfy- Right now I honestly feel that I can call her by her first name (Maybe this should be shortened :P)} {Comment: Sounds about right, since I can't think of any other way to say it... - megu} {Comment: Also, should we include a note here about the way Japanese use first names/yobisute? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:35.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, can I join in too, Su- {Wolfy- Erm, can I join in too, Su-}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Su? So what is after the Su, Haru? {Su? So what comes after the "Su", Haru? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:41.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, say it! Say it! {Come on, say it! Say it! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:43.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be shy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:46.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey you guys, stop teasing them. {him?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:47.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We aren't teasing them. {him?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:49.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's right, we aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:52.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,We're just giving them our moral support! {We're just backing them up with our moral support! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.79,0:07:55.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Go, go! Haru-tan, do your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:59.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And I just said no teasing them. {:p} {SOLO SQUAD UNITE!!} {And I just said "No teasing"... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:02.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Guess it's impossible in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:14.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:22.63,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:32.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:34.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What a nice mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:36.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:39.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,E-Err, the entrance bell is... {doorbell? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:43.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:45.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:52.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I got permission to get off early.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:54.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.01,0:09:00.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to visit Yuuki-san too. Is that alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:02.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:06.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:08.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hello, this is Tsuwabuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:11.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun? You came at the right time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:20.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.11,0:09:22.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, we're here... {Wolfy- Erm, we're here...}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:24.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:28.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun, please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.03,0:09:34.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have some of your transformation potion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:39.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Since Miss doesn't want to listen to anything at the moment.{- megu}{Since right now Miss does not really want to listen to anything.}{Wolfy- Since at the moment Miss doesn't want to listen to anything}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.67,0:09:42.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Uhh, what do you mean? {Uhh, what do you mean? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.69,0:09:45.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! Those ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:51.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I was trying to put the potions in batches when this accident happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.68,0:09:53.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So it was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:54.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:58.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I ended up taking the wrong juice when I bumped into you at school!{I mistakenly taken the wrong juice when I bumped into you at school!}{Wolfy- I accidentally took the wrong juice when I bumped into you at school!} {took -> drank - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:02.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Because of that, I change to a sheep doll at night! {Wolfy- I turn into a Sheep doll at night} {And because of that, I have to turn into a sheep doll at night! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.01,0:10:08.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Err... Tsuwabuki-kun, you're not from Figurare?{Err... You are not someone from Figurare, Tsuwabuki-kun?} {Err... So Tsuwabuki-kun, you're not from Figurare? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:13.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No! I changed to a sheep doll because of the potion that you dropped!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.62,0:10:18.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ehh?! I am so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:20.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What have I done to Miss's classmate!?{What did I do on Miss' passing day!/What have I done to Miss' classmate!} {Wolfy- Second one sounds better} {What have I done to my Miss's classmate!? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.37,0:10:28.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.49,0:10:33.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.49,0:10:37.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, you are forgiving me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:41.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well yeah, since it wasn't all that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:45.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:52.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I will call Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:54.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:55.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:57.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nona-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you feeling better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:02.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:04.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Here are some flowers. {wolfy- Here are some flowers.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.53,0:11:11.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:14.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nona-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.58,0:11:17.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to be called that name by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:20.99,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Speerio Sharuruze Wein
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:27.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I am Saint Aspalas' Prima, Prima Aspalas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.99,0:11:30.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do our last battle today!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:33.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Come, Prima Plam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.55,0:11:36.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.93,0:11:45.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:48.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave Haru-kun to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:52.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Yaeno! Hey!{Oi, Yaeno, oi!} {Hey, Yaeno! Hey! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:55.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki, I'll explain later.{Tsuwabuki, I'll tell you the reason after this.}{Tsuwabuki, I'll explain later. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.40,0:11:58.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I mean. I'm...{No I don't mean that, I'm...}{That wasn't what I meant, I'm... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:04.81,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Speerio Rosa Burosa
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:09.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So you even know the transformation Recipe now too. {wolfy- So you even know the transform recipe too.} {So, you've also gotten the transformation recipe. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.41,0:12:14.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you're becoming more and more of a worthy opponent.{Right, now it's worth to defeat you./Right, you're becoming more and more of a worthy opponent.}{check} {wolfy- second one sounds better}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:16.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Arthur! The vial.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:19.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.37,0:12:27.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The star drops...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:30.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, what are you doing...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:37.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Wah, the star drops are...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:46.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Now, which of us can capture the star drops!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:48.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Time to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:12.11,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Paradivu Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.26,0:13:19.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.64,0:13:22.49,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Aquavu Puruvida!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:31.69,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Puruvi Radius!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.31,0:13:38.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She used the water to lure the star drops?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:42.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And capturing three of them at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:45.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Aspalas-san is amazing, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:47.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let me go, Yaeno!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:49.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let me go to Akihime. {Let me see Akihime! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:50.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:52.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yaeno...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:55.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.57,0:13:59.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yaeno.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.66,0:14:02.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki, I cannot let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:04.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it means I have to use force. {Wolfy- Even if it means I have to use force} {Even if it means that I'll have to use force. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.38,0:14:06.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yaeno...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.25,0:14:11.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If you work hard, you will gain power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:14.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I thought that's how it went.{Wolfy- I thought that's how it goes}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.55,0:14:22.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But you on the other hand receive new powers just by doing it without any practice. {But you, on the other hand, recieved new powers without any practice. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.93,0:14:25.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:26.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I will not approve of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:29.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're the only person I don't want to lose to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:30.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:35.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I have to let Yuki-chan return to the Doll Land too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:38.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way that I'll lose!{- megu}{No way I will lose!}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.93,0:14:42.14,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.25,0:14:47.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.21,0:14:51.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right, a Recipe that can slow down time.{Right, a Recipe that will slow time.}{Right, a recipe that can slow down time. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:54.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can do it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:57.93,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Patis Aqua Omis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:02.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I've got it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:06.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I have to do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.05,0:15:10.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,For Yuki-chan's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:13.71,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Tamo Rei! {check recipe/spell}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.46,0:15:17.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:24.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You must be kidding! From that far away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:28.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let you do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:30.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.33,0:15:32.55,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:36.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.55,0:15:38.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:41.11,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:43.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.85,0:15:45.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me I screwed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:47.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, watch out!{Watch out Miss!} {Miss, watch out! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:50.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be dangerous if you keep on casting that spell!{- megu}{It will be dangerous if you continue on casting that spell!}{Wolfy-It will be dangerous if you carry on casting that spell}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:52.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, Aspalas-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.81,0:15:54.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That Recipe is not normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:58.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:01.06,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.49,0:16:04.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:14.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Aspalas-... No! Nona-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.28,0:16:16.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nona-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:20.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:22.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.59,0:16:23.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:28.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I will not stand by and do nothing while Akihime is in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:31.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki, if anything happens to you, Sumomo will be sad. {Wolfy-If anything were t  happen to you, Sumomo would be sad, Tsuwabuki.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.05,0:16:34.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be Sumomo's strength too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.65,0:16:39.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But... I cannot, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:41.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can. There's something that I can do! {wolfy- there is something I can do} {I can.. There's something that I can do! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:43.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:47.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Because I have always been with Akihime gathering the star drops. {Because I've always known that Akihime has been gathering star drops. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:52.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki, how do you know about the star drops...? {Wolfy- Tsuwabuki, how do you know about the star drops?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.57,0:16:55.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.15,0:16:59.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nona-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:01.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:03.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Please say something, Nona-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.85,0:17:07.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,T-This is....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:13.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:15.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The two of them are inside!{The two miss is inside!}{wolfy- The two miss' are inside} {The two of them are inside! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:17.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Inside this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:22.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:24.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.76,0:17:34.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo! Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.95,0:17:39.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You must never do that, Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:43.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If your real identity is known to Sumomo-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:47.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,you will cease to move, think or speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.74,0:17:50.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You will become just a normal doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.36,0:17:51.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:57.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:05.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:10.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You're right, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.45,0:18:12.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I have to do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:16.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I have to help Nona-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:19.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! If I use that chant...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:23.93,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:29.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:30.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:32.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.48,0:18:36.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.31,0:18:38.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.91,0:18:41.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, slow down time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:43.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's the same chant as last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.32,0:18:45.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You should be able to slow down the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.50,0:18:47.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you know that, Haru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.55,0:18:48.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:53.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to, but I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:57.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You can do it. You can do it, Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.00,0:18:59.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You definitely can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.84,0:19:00.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just be calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.73,0:19:05.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best, Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.05,0:19:13.34,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Timu Forna Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:24.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:26.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:28.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nona-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:40.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The wind was caused by this Ladle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.25,0:19:43.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:45.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The Ladle is hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.59,0:19:47.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.73,0:19:49.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:51.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.19,0:19:53.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:57.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to do something for you too, Sumomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.85,0:20:02.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Not just watching you but something like what Tsuwabuki does.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.75,0:20:46.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss! Miss get a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:47.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:52.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:56.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:57.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Matsuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.15,0:20:59.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to me? {wolfy- What happened to me?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:05.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This thing went berserk and caused that big whirlwind.{This thing went berserk and caused great wind.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:09.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo went into it and saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.29,0:21:17.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.78,0:21:19.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Because Sumomo is a kind girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:30.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So Haru-kun is... Haru-kun is Yuki-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:35.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for lying until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.66,0:21:41.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No. I'm always being helped by Yuki-chan.{No. I'm always getting consoled by Yuki-chan.}{wolfy- I'm always being consoled by Yuki-chan} {No. I was the one always being helped by Yuki-chan. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.16,0:21:46.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And seeing Haru-kun's face at school makes me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:50.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun, thanks for everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:53.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.35,0:21:55.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.64,0:22:03.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Su-mo-mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.49,0:22:14.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.69,0:22:21.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.05,0:22:23.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.05,0:22:29.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,T-Tsuwabuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:34.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.38,0:22:40.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Come on, please say something!{Hey, hey, please say something!}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.25,0:22:42.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.59,0:22:44.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.24,0:24:23.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Time is really precious, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.41,0:24:26.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't it be like a game where you can just reload and try again?{Why don't it be like game where you can just reload and do it right?}{Wolfy- Why can't it be like a game where you can just reload and try again?}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.93,0:24:28.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But I heard that you can return, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.95,0:24:29.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What, what?
